# The Vercel project builds wangari-next/ only. Everything else in this repo is
# either the backend, agent scratch, or local database copies, and uploading them
# only slows the deploy (and once broke it: the .freebuff scratch DB alone is 95 MB).
#
# Every image pattern below is anchored with a leading slash on purpose. In
# ignore-file syntax a bare "*.png" matches at ANY depth, so it also excluded
# wangari-next/public/icons/*.png and wangari-next/public/images/*.png — which
# deployed a live site whose logo, og:image, apple-touch-icon and PWA icons all
# 404'd. Anchor to the repo root and the app keeps its own artwork.
.freebuff/
agent/
audit-shots/
skills/
.agents/
.claude/
.kiro/
.vercel-disabled/
/skills-lock.json
/server/
/media-master/
/*.png
/login-attempt.png
/waadmin-overview-desktop.png
/docs/*.png
/docs/*.html
/docs/*.json
/wangari-next/.vercel
/wangari-next/.env*
/wangari-next/next-env.d.ts